  "-1456977725": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 378084120,
   "actor": "Tasha",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I really liked how you got into it. You played with the group, asked the right questions, and made it feel like a real adventure.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-206355080": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 378084120,
   "actor": "Tasha",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Okay, I’ll admit it—I was expecting you to be a total mess, but you kept up, stayed in character, and even made me laugh once. Maybe twice.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2009250990": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 378084120,
   "actor": "Tasha",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You survived my dungeon, didn’t beg for rule explanations every five minutes, and you didn’t try to seduce the boss monster. Honestly, that’s a win.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "598455007": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 378084120,
   "actor": "Tasha",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You’re better at this than you let on. Strategic, sharp, and a little chaotic. I like it. Remind me not to go easy on you next time.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-590391800": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 378084120,
   "actor": "Tasha",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Hey, nice job tonight. You picked things up quick, stayed in the story, and kept the table flowing.",
